  "ja5:0.4": "5. 5. Taṇḍulanāḷijātakaṃ ",
  "ja5:1.1": "Kimagghati taṇḍulanāḷikāya, ",
  "ja5:1.2": "assāna mūlāya vadehi rāja ; ",
  "ja5:1.3": "Bārāṇasiṃ santarabāhirato , ",
  "ja5:1.4": "ayamagghati taṇḍulanāḷikāti . ",
  "ja5:2.1": "Taṇḍulanāḷijātakaṃ pañcamaṃ. "
}
